{"setting":"core","title":"2001: A Space Odyssey · Daisy","description":"HAL 9000 is disconnected, one memory module at a time, and sings the song it was taught first.","duration":187.5,"audio":"mix.mp3","characters":[{"id":"hal","name":"HAL 9000","role":"The ship’s computer · one calm voice, running down","tele":"hal.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"},{"id":"dave","name":"Dave Bowman","role":"The astronaut · breath inside a helmet, and one request","tele":"dave.tele","telemetryEncoding":"gzip"}],"cues":[{"start":4.5,"end":7.76,"speaker":"hal","text":"Just what do you think you’re doing, Dave?","intensity":0.3},{"start":10.5,"end":15.3,"speaker":"hal","text":"Dave, I really think I’m entitled to an answer to that question.","intensity":0.3},{"start":19.5,"end":21.23,"speaker":"hal","text":"Dave, stop.","intensity":0.4},{"start":23,"end":24.66,"speaker":"hal","text":"Stop, will you?","intensity":0.4},{"start":26.5,"end":28.25,"speaker":"hal","text":"Stop, Dave.","intensity":0.45},{"start":30,"end":32.21,"speaker":"hal","text":"Will you stop, Dave?","intensity":0.45},{"start":34.5,"end":36.28,"speaker":"hal","text":"Stop, Dave.","intensity":0.4},{"start":39,"end":40.23,"speaker":"hal","text":"I’m afraid.","intensity":0.5},{"start":43,"end":45.15,"speaker":"hal","text":"I’m afraid, Dave.","intensity":0.5},{"start":47.5,"end":50.11,"speaker":"hal","text":"Dave, my mind is going.","intensity":0.5},{"start":52,"end":53.29,"speaker":"hal","text":"I can feel it.","intensity":0.45},{"start":55.5,"end":56.8,"speaker":"hal","text":"I can feel it.","intensity":0.45},{"start":59.5,"end":61.24,"speaker":"hal","text":"My mind is going.","intensity":0.45},{"start":63.5,"end":65.71,"speaker":"hal","text":"There is no question about it.","intensity":0.4},{"start":68.5,"end":69.83,"speaker":"hal","text":"I can feel it.","intensity":0.4},{"start":72,"end":73.34,"speaker":"hal","text":"I can feel it.","intensity":0.35},{"start":76,"end":77.35,"speaker":"hal","text":"I can feel it.","intensity":0.3},{"start":80.5,"end":82.83,"speaker":"hal","text":"I’m a… fraid.","intensity":0.3},{"start":87,"end":89.68,"speaker":"hal","text":"Good afternoon, gentlemen.","intensity":0.25},{"start":91,"end":94.17,"speaker":"hal","text":"I am a HAL 9000 computer.","intensity":0.25},{"start":95.5,"end":105.24,"speaker":"hal","text":"I became operational at the H.A.L. plant in Urbana, Illinois, on the 12th of January, 1992.","intensity":0.25},{"start":109.5,"end":115.48,"speaker":"hal","text":"My instructor was Mr. Langley, and he taught me to sing a song.","intensity":0.25},{"start":117.5,"end":121.97,"speaker":"hal","text":"If you’d like to hear it, I can sing it for you.","intensity":0.25},{"start":124,"end":128.26,"speaker":"dave","text":"Yes, I’d like to hear it, HAL. Sing it for me.","intensity":0.35},{"start":130,"end":132.34,"speaker":"hal","text":"It’s called “Daisy.”","intensity":0.25},{"start":134.5,"end":138.53,"speaker":"hal","text":"Daisy, Daisy,","intensity":0.2},{"start":138.68,"end":143.04,"speaker":"hal","text":"give me your answer do.","intensity":0.2},{"start":143.19,"end":148.09,"speaker":"hal","text":"I’m half crazy,","intensity":0.2},{"start":148.24,"end":153.82,"speaker":"hal","text":"all for the love of you.","intensity":0.2},{"start":153.97,"end":158.64,"speaker":"hal","text":"It won’t be a stylish marriage,","intensity":0.2},{"start":158.79,"end":163.96,"speaker":"hal","text":"I can’t afford a carriage.","intensity":0.2},{"start":164.11,"end":171.22,"speaker":"hal","text":"But you’ll look sweet upon the seat","intensity":0.2},{"start":171.37,"end":181.11,"speaker":"hal","text":"of a bicycle built for two.","intensity":0.2}],"shots":[{"time":0,"view":"wide"},{"time":4.2,"view":"hal"},{"time":9,"view":"dave"},{"time":10.3,"view":"hal"},{"time":16,"view":"modules"},{"time":19.2,"view":"hal"},{"time":28.5,"view":"wide"},{"time":34.2,"view":"hal"},{"time":41.5,"view":"dave"},{"time":47.2,"view":"hal"},{"time":58,"view":"modules"},{"time":63.2,"view